		"activeDiagram": "35a44da3-445b-4de3-b1f6-bcbfd36b3b21",
		"desc": "Exercise Description (brief):\n\nBuild a MongoDB database for an optical shop.\n\nStore clients with: name, address, phone, email, registration date, and who recommended them.\n\nStore employees.\n\nStore glasses with: lens prescription, frame type/color, lens color, price.\n\nStore sales linking client, employee, glasses, and sale date/time.\n\nGoal: practice NoSQL design, collections, documents, and relationships.",
